# Android wide loop relocation patcher for two hundred fifty five slots
# Source uses only standard Brainfuck commands
# Input begins with one byte count followed by encoded branch records
# The record terminator has two zero bytes
# Remaining input carries forty eight bytes for each command slot
# Output is patched slots and two trailing zero bytes
# Bracket matching and input lengths are validated by upstream stages
# This BF stage trusts those upstream verified frame boundaries
# One byte positions limit this patcher to two hundred fifty five slots
